parameters.text:
=Compile and prioritize these funding opportunities for an MS in AI applicant.

Profile: {{ $('Set Research Profile').item.json.applicant_type }}
Research Area: {{ $('Set Research Profile').item.json.research_area }}
Target Programs: {{ $('Set Research Profile').item.json.target_programs }}

Global Scholarships:
{{ $('Search Global AI Scholarships').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Indian Government Funding:
{{ $('Search Indian Gov Funding').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Industry Fellowships:
{{ $('Search Industry Fellowships').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Return JSON:
{
  "urgent_deadlines": [{"name": "", "amount": "", "deadline": "", "eligibility_match": "high/medium/low", "apply_url": ""}],
  "upcoming_opportunities": [{"name": "", "amount": "", "opens": "", "notes": ""}],
  "always_open": [{"name": "", "description": "", "url": ""}],
  "highest_priority_action": "",
  "total_potential_funding": "",
  "weekly_summary": "2-3 sentence summary of this week's funding landscape"
}

=🎓 *Weekly Funding Opportunities — {{ $now.toFormat('MMM dd') }}*

{{ $json.weekly_summary }}

*⚡ Urgent Deadlines:*
{{ $json.urgent_deadlines.map(g=>`• ${g.name}: ${g.amount} — Deadline: ${g.deadline} (Match: ${g.eligibility_match})`).join('\n') }}

*Coming Up:*
{{ $json.upcoming_opportunities.slice(0,3).map(g=>`• ${g.name}: ${g.amount} — Opens: ${g.opens}`).join('\n') }}

*#1 Action This Week:* {{ $json.highest_priority_action }}
*Total Potential Funding:* {{ $json.total_potential_funding }}
